---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy · NicheDomainRadar">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 font-mono leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>NicheDomainRadar respects your privacy. We collect minimal information required to deliver our domain analytics services, such as your email address when subscribing to Pro membership or our daily newsletter.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information exclusively to provide domain alerts, manage Pro license activations, process subscription billing via Stripe, and communicate daily radar reports.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">3. Payment Processing</h2>
      <p>All payments are securely processed by Stripe. We do not store or transmit full credit card details on our servers.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For any privacy inquiries or license support, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:support@nichedomainradar.com" class="text-emerald-400 underline">support@nichedomainradar.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
